 2
Write a PL/SQL program that prompts for EMPNO, ENAME and SAL
and inserts them into EMP table.
Use Unnamed System Defined Exception Handler.
====================================================================

SQL Command:
------------

sql> ACCEPT P_EMPNO PROMPT 'Enter Employee Number : '
sql> ACCEPT P_ENAME PROMPT 'Enter Employee Name   : '
sql> ACCEPT P_SAL PROMPT 'Enter Salary          : '

sql> BEGIN

INSERT INTO EMP
(EMPNO,ENAME,SAL)
VALUES
(&P_EMPNO,'&P_ENAME',&P_SAL);

COMMIT;

DBMS_OUTPUT.PUT_LINE('Employee Inserted.');

EXCEPTION

WHEN OTHERS THEN

DBMS_OUTPUT.PUT_LINE
('System Error : '||SQLERRM);

END;
/

Output:
-------

Enter Employee Number : 7369
Enter Employee Name   : TEST
Enter Salary          : 5000

System Error :
ORA-00001: unique constraint violated

PL/SQL procedure successfully completed.


